    {
      "id": "p4kywV",
      "type": "ref",
      "ref": "Rf9zi",
      "name": "Аннотация · foundations/tokens",
      "x": 1664,
      "y": 1600,
      "content": "# input: stableId — creator.slug for creators, product.publicId for works\n# output: index 0..5 into accent_order\nfunction accentIndex(stableId):\n    h = 0\n    for byte in utf8_bytes(stableId):\n        h = (h * 31 + byte) mod 2^32\n    return h mod 6\n\nmotion.durations\nmicro: 120\nstandard: 200\ngallery: 240\nentrance: 280\n\nmotion.easings\nstandard: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)\ndecelerate: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1)\nsettle: cubic-bezier(0.16, 0.84, 0.44, 1)\n\nAll transitions become instant state swaps (0ms) or single 120ms opacity fades; stack renders final tilt without settle; live_dot static; skeleton shimmer becomes static two-tone; gallery advance is instant swap; sticky bar appears without slide.",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 420,
      "fill": "$ink_soft"
    },
